---
/**
 * Cookie Policy — English text. Shown by src/views/LegalPage.astro inside
 * <article class="legal__doc">. Headings start at h2 (the page title is the h1).
 */
import { pagePath } from '../../i18n/languages';
---

<h2>1. What this policy covers</h2>
<p>
  This policy explains which cookies and similar technologies (such as storage in your
  browser) are used on www.tangomj.nl, run by TangoMJ, a trade name of Het Waterwerk
  Rimburg V.O.F. It complements our <a href={pagePath('privacyPolicy', 'en')}>Privacy Policy</a>.
</p>

<h2>2. How we ask for your consent</h2>
<p>
  On your first visit a banner lets you choose: <strong>Accept all</strong>,
  <strong>Reject optional</strong> or <strong>Cookie settings</strong>. There are two
  categories:
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Necessary</strong> &ndash; always on. Needed for the website to work and to
    remember your cookie choice.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Analytics</strong> &ndash; off unless you switch it on. Google Analytics is only
    loaded after you accept this category.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  We do not use marketing, advertising or retargeting cookies. Your choice is kept for 12
  months, after which we ask again. You can change it at any time:
  <button type="button" class="legal__cookie-btn" data-cookie-settings>Manage cookies</button>
</p>

<h2>3. Cookies and storage on this website</h2>
<div class="legal__table-wrap">
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Name</th>
        <th>Provider</th>
        <th>Purpose</th>
        <th>Duration</th>
        <th>Category</th>
        <th>First / third party</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><code>tangomj-cookie-consent</code><br />(browser storage, not a cookie)</td>
        <td>TangoMJ (this website)</td>
        <td>Remembers your cookie choice: consent version, date and whether analytics is allowed. No personal data.</td>
        <td>Asked again after 12 months; removed when you clear your browser data</td>
        <td>Necessary</td>
        <td>First party</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>_ga</code></td>
        <td>Google (Google Analytics 4)</td>
        <td>Distinguishes visitors so visits can be counted.</td>
        <td>Up to 2 years according to Google; some browsers (e.g. Chrome) limit cookies to 400 days</td>
        <td>Analytics (only with consent)</td>
        <td>First-party cookie set by a Google script; data is sent to Google</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>_ga_P4B9P3VQVR</code></td>
        <td>Google (Google Analytics 4)</td>
        <td>Keeps track of the current visit (session) for our Analytics property.</td>
        <td>Up to 2 years according to Google; some browsers (e.g. Chrome) limit cookies to 400 days</td>
        <td>Analytics (only with consent)</td>
        <td>First-party cookie set by a Google script; data is sent to Google</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<p>
  The cookie names and the 400-day lifetime were observed in a test of this website. The
  purposes and the two-year lifetime are taken from Google&rsquo;s own documentation for
  Google Analytics 4.
</p>
<p>
  With your consent, Google Analytics receives information such as the pages you visit,
  your browser and device type, an approximate location based on your IP address, and the
  page you came from. Google may process this data outside the European Economic Area.
  See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google&rsquo;s Privacy Policy</a>.
</p>

<h2>4. Other services that receive data from your browser</h2>
<p>These services set no cookies on this website, but your browser does contact them:</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    <strong>Make.com</strong> &ndash; only when you send the contact form, the details you
    typed (name, email, topic and message) are sent to Make.com, which forwards them to us.
    Nothing is sent when you only visit a page.
  </li>
  <li>
    <strong>Links to other websites</strong> &ndash; links to Facebook, Instagram, TikTok,
    WhatsApp and Google are ordinary links. Nothing is loaded from those sites until you
    click a link; after that, their own cookie and privacy policies apply.
  </li>
</ul>
<p>
  <strong>YouTube</strong> &ndash; the video on the About page is only loaded when you press play.
  Until then the page shows a still image stored on this website and contacts nobody. After you press
  play, the video comes from youtube-nocookie.com (Google), which receives information such as your IP
  address and may set its own cookies or similar technologies; Google&rsquo;s privacy policy then applies.
</p>
<p>
  The Inter typeface is served from this website itself, so your browser does not contact
  Google Fonts.
</p>

<h2>5. What we could not determine</h2>
<p>
  Whether our hosting provider sets cookies or keeps server logs (such as IP addresses)
  cannot be determined from the website itself. If it does, we will add the details here.
</p>

<h2>6. Changing or deleting your choice</h2>
<p>
  Use &ldquo;Manage cookies&rdquo; at the bottom of every page. If you withdraw consent for
  analytics, Google Analytics stops on that page and its cookies are deleted. You can also
  delete cookies and site data at any time in your browser settings; the banner will then
  appear again.
</p>

<h2>7. Contact</h2>
<p>
  Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:info@tangomj.nl">info@tangomj.nl</a>.
</p>
